<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Serene and therapeutic, placid lakes and lapping shores are criminally underappreciated. With a little time or simple engineering rivers and oceans alike can leave our bellies full of tasty fish.-->
  <VME_Angler.description>传播我们的信仰是我们的责任，即使是通过武力。</VME_Angler.description>
  <VME_Angler.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: creation(tag=meme_Anglers)        ->[deity0_name] spoke to all [deity0_possessive] followers and told them: "Again, the kingdom of heaven is like a dragnet cast into the sea, and gathering fish of every kind."-->
    <li>creation(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name]在凡人中指定了一些十字军来执行[deity0_possessive]的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: episode(uses=1,tag=meme_Anglers)  ->[deity0_name] said to all the [memberNamePlural], "Follow Me, and I will make you fishers of men."-->
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name] 对所有 [memberNamePlural] 说，“异教徒必须接受我的话，否则就会灭亡。”</li>
    <!--EN: intro(tag=meme_Anglers)           ->[memberNamePlural] built a great [altarName] on the [place_summary] [place_name], and great angling competitions took place there every year.-->
    <li>intro(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[memberNamePlural] 在 [place_summary] [place_name] 上建造了一个伟大的 [altarName]，因此很多人都会屈服于 [deity0_name] 的意愿。</li>
    <!--EN: conflict(tag=meme_Anglers)        ->An envious [foeLeader], seeking to deny the will of [deity0_name], told [foeLeader_possessive] [foeSoldiers] to poison the lakes and seas surrounding the [altarName].-->
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 一个胆小鬼 [foeLeader] 试图否认 [deity0_name] 的意愿，告诉 [foeLeader_possessive] [foeSoldiers] 割掉任何谈论 [deity0_type] 的人的舌头。</li>
    <!--EN: founderJoin(tag=meme_Anglers)     ->[deity0_name] blessed a [place_job] named [founderName] with [deity0_possessive] divine intelligence and [founder_pronoun] built a great water purifier, and the waters once again teamed with thousands of fish.-->
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name] 以 [deity0_possessive] 坚定的决心祝福名为 [founderName] 的 [place_job]，当 [founder_pronoun] 说话时，没有人可以转身。</li>
    <!--EN: victory(tag=meme_Anglers)         ->The [foeSoldiers] and the [foeLeader] were humiliated and thwarted, and they had to leave the [memberNamePlural] alone.-->
    <li>victory(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[founderName]屠杀了许多[foeSoldiers]并残酷地折磨了幸存者，以展示[deity0_name]的力量。他们痛苦的呼喊将永远提醒我们那些否认[deity0_name]的人的命运。</li>
    <!--EN: setup(tag=meme_Anglers)           ->Our founder [founderName] was the greatest angler to have lived. No fish was big enough for [founderName_objective].-->
    <li>setup(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;我们的创始人 [founderName] 是一位伟大的革命者和天才，在 [founder_pronoun] 穿梭于各个城市之间时，改变了数千人的信仰。</li>
    <!--EN: story(uses=1,tag=meme_Anglers)    ->[founderName] taught us that fishing is a state of mind. [founderName_pronoun] always said that the charm of fishing is that it is the pursuit of what is elusive but attainable, a perpetual series of occasions for hope.-->
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;信徒们在城市和机构之间流动，传播新秩序的消息并战斗反对那些不同意的人。</li>
    <!--EN: lessonIntro(tag=meme_Anglers)         ->I've spent as much of my life fishing as decency allowed, and sometimes I don't let even that get in my way. I have learned that-->
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 在传播我们的理念的这些年里，我学到了一个重要的教训：</li>
    <!--EN: lesson(tag=meme_Anglers)              ->fishing is a hard job. Fishing at night. Rain. Day, night. You have to be wise and smart. And quick.-->
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;除了我们的真理，没有任何真理。我们不能让任何人妨碍我们。他们要么同意，要么死</li>
    <!--EN: lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_Anglers) ->After a day's fishing, I'll know the solution to something or have good ideas that were not accessible before.-->
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;这就是我们需要传播、传播、传播的事实。如果有必要，可以用武力。</li>
    <!--EN: archistBasis(tag=meme_Anglers)    ->The archotechs filled the oceans and the rivers with wondrous plenty, accessible to anyone with the knowledge to take advantage of it.-->
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; Archotechs 从天空和心灵中宣布他们的存在，并且他们的存在必须成为普遍真理。</li>
    <!--EN: archistFact(tag=meme_Anglers)     ->Archotechs value resourcefulness above other things, and we must accept the bounty of the waters as their gift.-->
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;Archotechs 必须被服从，我们有责任让他人屈服于他们的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: archistProphecy(tag=meme_Anglers) ->[inTheEnd], the archotechs will be the greatest anglers, and their catch will be the ones worthy of transcendence.-->
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[inTheEnd]，考古技术人员将向 [relic0_name] 的持有者表达他们最后的智慧。凡是不听话的人都必须被清除。</li>
    <!--EN: animistFact(tag=meme_Anglers)     ->The spirits of fish provide us with the greatest bounty: the teeming life present in rivers and oceans.-->
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 灵魂想要被人认识，但只与少数人交谈。我们会让任何阻碍我们的人敬畏神灵的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: serketistProphecy(tag=meme_Anglers)->[itIsSaid] we will learn the ways of insects to find food whenever it's needed, by exploiting the greatest bounty: the teeming life present in rivers and oceans.-->
    <li>serketistProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;[itIsSaid]我们将向他们学习，并利用这些知识来清除宇宙中肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_Anglers)->Ph'nglui mglw'nafh [deity0_name] [place_name] wgah'nagl fhtagn.-->
    <li>chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;我们将获得他们的可怕知识，并用它来清除宇宙中肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_Anglers)->We will discern what is hidden behind these secrets, perhaps by divining the entrails of dead fish.-->
    <li>esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;有了这些知识，我们将比这个星球上的其他居民拥有明显的优势，并用它来清除肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismFact(tag=meme_Anglers)->Like the slippery fish that hide beyond the abyssal depths, we will strike from the darkness and we will be unstoppable.-->
    <li>eschatologismFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;什么都不会剩下。肮脏的异教徒将被原子火和致命疾病所清除。</li>
    <!--EN: introMemo(tag=meme_Anglers)->Good news! In this year's company-wide raffle we are again including as a prize a two weeks, all expenses paid fishing trip! I know you are as excited as I am, so get those tickets as soon as possible!-->
    <li>introMemo(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt; 如您所知，我们公司的使命太重要了，不能让其他人妨碍我们，因此我们正在准备一次敌意合并，以摆脱这些……不受欢迎的竞争对手。</li>
  </VME_Angler.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
